---

This project includes prebuilt binaries from third-party tools, each subject
to their own licenses:

- makerom, ctrtool: BSD 2-Clause (3DSGuy/Project_CTR)
- 3dstool:           MIT (dnasdw/3dstool)
- bannertool:        MIT (carstene1ns/3ds-bannertool, fork of Steveice10/bannertool)

The bundled `template/` directory contains a small set of structural bytes
(~41 KB total) extracted from a Game Boy Advance Virtual Console title's
NCCH headers. These bytes are used as a permission template so that custom
GBA injects can launch on a hacked 3DS via Luma3DS's signature bypass. No
game-specific content (ROM data, game icon art, game banner art, audio, or
game text) is included.

The bundle does include `logo.darc.lz` (8 KB) — the standardized "GAME BOY
ADVANCE" boot animation that plays when launching any GBA VC title. This
file is required by the AGB_FIRM launcher; without it, titles will not boot.
We include it so injects feel native to the GBA experience.

If you are a copyright holder and believe any of these bytes should not be
included, please open an issue.
